  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a Business – Mixed Use zoned freehold site in the heart of Mairangi Bay Village — combining strategic commercial potential with the long-term security of premium school zoning in one of the North Shore’s most tightly held coastal communities.\r\n\r\nPositioned just moments from cafés, boutique retail, professional services, and the beach, this property offers outstanding flexibility under the Auckland Unitary Plan, making it ideal for investors, developers, business owners, or those seeking a future-focused land-banking opportunity.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights:\r\nBusiness – Mixed Use Zone (Auckland Unitary Plan)\r\n\r\nAllows for a wide range of commercial, residential, or mixed-use outcomes (subject to council consent), including offices, professional rooms, boutique retail, or residential components above.\r\n\r\nHeart of Mairangi Bay Village\r\n\r\nStrategic village position benefiting from strong local foot traffic, established amenities, and immediate access to coastal lifestyle attractions.\r\n\r\nFreehold 250sqm Site\r\n\r\nA compact and efficient landholding — ideal for boutique development, owner-occupiers, or long-term land banking in a high-demand seaside precinct.\r\n\r\nScarce & Tightly Held\r\n\r\nLimited supply of Mixed Use land in Mairangi Bay, with strict planning controls and very few comparable opportunities available.\r\n\r\nZoned for Sought-After Schools\r\n\r\nLocated within the highly regarded school zones of Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Rangitoto College — an added layer of long-term value rarely available with mixed-use opportunities.\r\n\r\nThis is a compelling blend of commercial flexibility, coastal village lifestyle, and premium school zoning — a combination seldom found in established North Shore locations.\r\n\r\nContact us today to explore the potential, request further information, or arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
